# Title: Potential Browser Data Stealing
# ID: 47147b5b-9e17-4d76-b8d2-7bac24c5ce1b
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2022-12-23
# Tags: attack.credential-access, attack.t1555.003
# Description: Adversaries may acquire credentials from web browsers by reading files specific to the target browser.
# Web browsers commonly save credentials such as website usernames and passwords so that they do not need to be entered manually in the future.
# Web browsers typically store the credentials in an encrypted format within a credential store.
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((((cmdline:*copy-item* OR cmdline:*copy * OR cmdline:*cpi * OR cmdline:* cp * OR cmdline:*move * OR cmdline:*move-item* OR cmdline:* mi * OR cmdline:* mv *)) OR ((process_name:*\\esentutl.exe OR process_name:*\\xcopy.exe OR process_name:*\\robocopy.exe)) OR ((OriginalFileName:"esentutl.exe" OR OriginalFileName:"XCOPY.EXE" OR OriginalFileName:"robocopy.exe"))) AND ((cmdline:*\\Amigo\\User Data* OR cmdline:*\\BraveSoftware\\Brave-Browser\\User Data* OR cmdline:*\\CentBrowser\\User Data* OR cmdline:*\\Chromium\\User Data* OR cmdline:*\\CocCoc\\Browser\\User Data* OR cmdline:*\\Comodo\\Dragon\\User Data* OR cmdline:*\\Elements Browser\\User Data* OR cmdline:*\\Epic Privacy Browser\\User Data* OR cmdline:*\\Google\\Chrome Beta\\User Data* OR cmdline:*\\Google\\Chrome SxS\\User Data* OR cmdline:*\\Google\\Chrome\\User Data\\* OR cmdline:*\\Kometa\\User Data* OR cmdline:*\\Maxthon5\\Users* OR cmdline:*\\Microsoft\\Edge\\User Data* OR cmdline:*\\Mozilla\\Firefox\\Profiles* OR cmdline:*\\Nichrome\\User Data* OR cmdline:*\\Opera Software\\Opera GX Stable\\* OR cmdline:*\\Opera Software\\Opera Neon\\User Data* OR cmdline:*\\Opera Software\\Opera Stable\\* OR cmdline:*\\Orbitum\\User Data* OR cmdline:*\\QIP Surf\\User Data* OR cmdline:*\\Sputnik\\User Data* OR cmdline:*\\Torch\\User Data* OR cmdline:*\\uCozMedia\\Uran\\User Data* OR cmdline:*\\Vivaldi\\User Data*)))
